## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Pickoff Default (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Endless Battle, Demon Hunter Sword, Great Dragon Spear, Malefic Roar, Blade of Despair
- Core: Endless Battle, Demon Hunter Sword, Great Dragon Spear
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use against magic lane pressure or chain control that can stop Zilong before Supreme Warrior creates space.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP frontliners keep the first target alive through the pickoff.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use against magic burst that can delete Zilong after he commits with Spear Strike.
- Total cost: 12440 gold

Default ranked setup for side-lane pickoffs, turret pressure, and safe escapes after the Endless Battle plus Demon Hunter Sword spike.

### Crit Split-Push (EXP)

- Items: Swift Boots, Windtalker, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Great Dragon Spear, Malefic Roar
- Core: Windtalker, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Great Dragon Spear when Use when the enemy lacks reliable chase and raw execution damage matters more than post-ultimate movement speed.; Sea Halberd over Haas's Claws when Use when regen or shield reduction is mandatory and Zilong can still survive with passive sustain.; Immortality over Great Dragon Spear when Use when one failed side-lane death gives the enemy Lord, base access, or a clean end call.
- Total cost: 11200 gold

Greedy side-lane setup for low-control drafts where Inspire and crit scaling let Zilong erase waves, turrets, and isolated squishies.

### Anti-Frontline Attack Effects (EXP)

- Items: Swift Boots, Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff, Sea Halberd, Malefic Roar
- Core: Corrosion Scythe, Demon Hunter Sword, Golden Staff
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Swift, Weapon Master, War Cry
- Battle spell: Inspire
- Flex: Tough Boots over Swift Boots when Use when crowd control or magic poke is the reason Zilong cannot stay on his first target.; Wind of Nature over Sea Halberd when Use against physical basic-attack burst when one immunity window lets Zilong finish the duel.; Immortality over Sea Halberd when Use in late-game Lord fights when a revive is worth more than anti-heal uptime.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Front-to-back option for tankier drafts, using Corrosion, Demon Hunter Sword, and Golden Staff to repeat attack effects instead of chasing crit burst.

